SUMMARY:Interest List: Mindful Speed Dating Event 35-54
DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\nThis is an applic
 ation-based event.\n\nUse this form to express interest in this event\nhtt
 ps://forms.gle/RFrKuEAmrL8ApDUAA\n\nRSVP on Meetup does not guarantee a sp
 ot.\nParticipation requires completing a short interest form and receiving
  a private registration link. This is paid event. Please do not make trave
 l plans or assume attendance until you receive a confirmation email.\n\nNe
 xt Step to express interest in this evnet\nhttps://forms.gle/RFrKuEAmrL8Ap
 DUAA\n\nAbout Event\nMeet in the Moment is a guided\, speed-dating style e
 xperience for conscious singles who want to slow down\, drop out of small 
 talk\, and connect with presence and authenticity.\nThis is not traditiona
 l speed dating. There is no pressure to perform\, impress\, or decide anyt
 hing in the moment. Instead\, you’ll be gently guided into embodied conn
 ection through simple mindfulness prompts\, structured one-on-one\nconvers
 ations\, and moments of reflection.\nThe intention is to help you feel gro
 unded\, relaxed\, and real while meeting others who value emotional availa
 bility\, curiosity\, and meaningful connection.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\n* A s
 hort opening grounding practice to help you arrive and settle\n* A series 
 of timed\, one-on-one conversations with gentle prompts\n* Clear structure
  so you can relax and be yourself\n* Space to reflect and notice how conne
 ction feels in your body\n* A warm\, inclusive\, and respectful environmen
 t\n\nYou do not need dating experience\, meditation experience\, or confid
 ence in small talk. Just come as you are.\n\nWho is this for\n\n* Singles 
 who want deeper connection\, not surface-level chatting\n* People who valu
 e mindfulness\, emotional awareness\, and authenticity\n* Those curious ab
 out meeting others in a slower\, more intentional way\n* Anyone feeling ti
 red of dating apps or conventional speed dating\n\nImportant Notes\n\n* Th
 is event is designed for people who are emotionally available and open to 
 respectful connection\n* You will never be asked to share anything you’r
 e uncomfortable sharing\n* Attraction is welcome\, but there is no expecta
 tion to match or follow up\n\nTicketing & Balance\n\nTo support a balanced
  experience\, tickets are offered by gender and capped to keep numbers eve
 n. If one ticket type sells out\, you may join the waitlist.\n\nWe run the
  event **every other month** with alternating age ranges: 35–54 and 55
 –74. Choose the session that aligns with your life stage.
